{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All currently depicted visuals and gameplay elements are a work in progress</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Golemworks\u00a0</strong></i>is an experimental fusion of tower defense and factory builder. You must assemble an army of metal automatons which automatically fight and defend the ancient golem foundry from waves of encroaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/1395ba7583afb59ce7057d9f4e1c25fd.poster.avif?t=1765392186\" width=274 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/1395ba7583afb59ce7057d9f4e1c25fd.webm?t=1765392186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/1395ba7583afb59ce7057d9f4e1c25fd.mp4?t=1765392186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Molds</strong> activate on a cooldown, and generate a golem core - the 'recipe' for an automaton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/0654c69d2fa619477b43ddc4da865f6b.poster.avif?t=1765392186\" width=302 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/0654c69d2fa619477b43ddc4da865f6b.webm?t=1765392186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/0654c69d2fa619477b43ddc4da865f6b.mp4?t=1765392186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catalysts</strong>\u00a0are the production infrastructure. They can add levels, elemental attributes, or otherwise alter a core </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/7ceedc07c9aa6b82fa3ae4315be2498f.poster.avif?t=1765392186\" width=274 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/7ceedc07c9aa6b82fa3ae4315be2498f.webm?t=1765392186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/7ceedc07c9aa6b82fa3ae4315be2498f.mp4?t=1765392186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory will hinge on your ability to strike a balance between optimizing the army composition and amplifying the strength for each automaton. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable units and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and varying difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All in-game art drawn by hand in Aseprite. Capsule art by @afique_asyraf</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918970?t=1765392186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/8776162da13f28d1980deb9bb31faa4901a885f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765392186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/f82336ffb666c6ba86cc78ff41bd40a7ea9b225a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765392186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati